              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.10.17+MAT.10.18+MAT.10.19+MAT.10.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 10.17-20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.12.11+LUK.12.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luka 12.11-12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Ariko mwirinde kuko bazabagambanira mu nkiko, muzakubitirwa mu masinagogi kandi muzahagarara imbere y'abategeka n'abami babampora, ngo mubabere ubuhamya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ubutumwa bwiza bukwiriye kubanza kumara kwamamazwa mu mahanga yose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibabajyana mu manza ntimuzahagarike imitima y'ibyo muzavuga, ahubwo ibyo muzabwirwa muri icyo gihe muzabe ari byo muvuga, kuko atari mwe muzaba muvuga, ahubwo ari Umwuka Wera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuvandimwe azagambanira mwene se ngo yicwe, na se w'umwana azamugambanira, abana bazagomera ababyeyi babicishe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.10.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 10.22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi muzangwa na bose babahora izina ryanjye, ariko uwihangana akageza imperuka ni we uzakizwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
